<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Banerj auction postponed.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Banerj auction postponed.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rio de Janeiro officials postponed Tuesday's scheduled auction of Banerj after a court injunction calling for the suspension of the state-owned bank's sale, the state's Planning Secretariat said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;The Rio de Janeiro state government had to delay the Banerj auction because of a court injunction granted to an association of the bank's employees,&quot; a spokeswoman for the Secretariat said.</p>
</text>
